cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use heka2abf in your research, please cite it using the metadata
  from this file.
title: heka2abf
abstract: >-
  Convert HEKA PatchMaster .dat files to ABF2 (Axon Binary Format 2),
  readable by Clampfit and pyABF. Self-contained ABF2 writer (no external
  ABF write dependency); multi-channel interleave storage; per-channel
  scale factors; V→mV and A→pA unit normalization; auto-detection of
  episodic vs gap-free acquisition; variable-length sweep handling via
  SIC synch array. Tkinter GUI and CLI included.
